Resulting system definition

UIF-OS v4.1 becomes a deterministic, event-sourced, provenance-preserving scientific intelligence platform in which external public data sources are dynamically discovered and normalized; credentials are runtime-managed; provider availability, quotas, and costs are evaluated before requests; raw observations remain immutable T0 evidence; deterministic transformations produce T1 features; probabilistic models produce separately versioned T2 inference; and every final analytical assertion can be traced through its complete source → transformation → model → conclusion lineage.
